{
  "$schema": "../schema/component.schema.json",
  "id": "morphing-tabs",
  "title": "变形标签页",
  "description": "用于在切换标签时呈现胶体粘连变形效果的字符串标签页组件。",
  "category": "misc",
  "tags": [
    "css",
    "tailwind"
  ],
  "platforms": [
    "web"
  ],
  "props": [
    {
      "name": "tabs",
      "type": "string[]",
      "required": true,
      "description": "标签集合。",
      "default": "[]"
    },
    {
      "name": "activeTab",
      "type": "string",
      "required": true,
      "description": "当前激活的标签。",
      "default": "\"\""
    },
    {
      "name": "margin",
      "type": "number",
      "required": false,
      "description": "激活标签左右的外边距。",
      "default": "20"
    },
    {
      "name": "class",
      "type": "string",
      "required": false,
      "description": "用于样式的额外类名。",
      "default": "\"\""
    },
    {
      "name": "blurStdDeviation",
      "type": "number",
      "required": false,
      "description": "SVG 模糊的 stdDeviation 值。",
      "default": "6"
    }
  ],
  "events": [
    {
      "name": "update:activeTab",
      "payload": "(e: \"update:activeTab\", tab: string): void;",
      "description": ""
    }
  ],
  "slots": [],
  "exposes": [],
  "examples": [
    {
      "title": "Web 演示",
      "code": "<script lang=\"ts\" setup>\nimport { ref } from \"vue\";\n\nconst tabs = [\"Home\", \"Apps\", \"About\", \"My\"];\nconst activeTab = ref(tabs[0]);\n</script>\n\n<template>\n  <MorphingTabs\n    :tabs=\"tabs\"\n    :active-tab=\"activeTab\"\n    @update:active-tab=\"activeTab = $event\"\n  />\n</template>\n",
      "source": "demo",
      "platform": "web"
    }
  ],
  "related": [],
  "whenToUse": [
    "落地页或个人站导航需要胶状变形的标签切换动效时。",
    "少量纯文字标签之间的视觉化切换。"
  ],
  "whenNotToUse": [
    "业务标签页需要内容面板或跨端支持，改用 reborn-tabs。",
    "底部主导航，改用 reborn-tabbar。"
  ],
  "pitfalls": [
    "仅 web 端可用，粘连效果基于 SVG 模糊滤镜（blurStdDeviation 控制 stdDeviation）。",
    "tabs 只接受 string[]，activeTab 为必填受控 prop，需监听 update:activeTab 回写。",
    "只负责标签头切换，不含内容面板，需自行根据 activeTab 渲染内容。"
  ],
  "dependencies": [],
  "install": {
    "cli": "npx reborn-ui@latest add morphing-tabs"
  },
